    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Athalia lies along the Ohio River and is part of the Huntington‑Ashland metropolitan area.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        13,
        14
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Athalia%2C_Ohio"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Two Mile Creek, a tributary that joins the Ohio River just upstream, has long influenced Athalia’s geography.",
